---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Roof Replacement Wake Forest NC | New Roofs Installed" description="Full roof replacement in Wake Forest, NC. Architectural shingles, metal, and flat systems. Manufacturer warranties, insurance help, clean job sites.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → <a href="/#services">Services</a> → Roof Replacement</div>
      <h1>Roof Replacement</h1>
      <p>Code-compliant new roofs with proper underlayment, ventilation, and long-term warranties.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Complete Roof Systems</h2>
      <p>When repair no longer makes sense, we install durable new roof systems tailored to Wake Forest homes and climate. Architectural asphalt shingles are the most common choice; we also install metal and flat (TPO/EPDM) systems where appropriate.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Full tear-off or recover options based on condition and code</li>
        <li>Quality underlayment and ice-and-water shield in critical areas</li>
        <li>Proper attic ventilation for longevity</li>
        <li>Manufacturer warranties plus our workmanship guarantee</li>
        <li>Insurance claim documentation and support</li>
        <li>Magnet sweep and thorough cleanup</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>When Replacement Makes Sense</h2>
      <p>Roofs approaching 20+ years, widespread storm or hail damage, repeated leaks, or soft decking. We provide a clear comparison so you can decide with confidence.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate — {phoneDisplay}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
